{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46851","headline":"送人自蜀回南游 · 齐己","name":"送人自蜀回南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦水东浮情尚郁，湘波南泛思何长。\n蜀魂巴狖悲残夜，越鸟燕鸿叫夕阳。\n烟月几般爲客路，林泉四绝是吾乡。\n寻幽必有僧相指，宋杜题诗近旧房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}